1
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:03,791
But I don't love you.

2
00:00:05,666 --> 00:00:06,750
I don't believe you.

3
00:00:07,583 --> 00:00:08,583
I don't—.

4
00:00:42,791 --> 00:00:44,208
You really don't feel anything?

5
00:00:45,375 --> 00:00:46,790
Your body tells me

6
00:00:46,791 --> 00:00:48,375
we feel the same way.

7
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,250
A-Leh.

8
00:00:51,666 --> 00:00:53,208
You're always like this.

9
00:00:53,916 --> 00:00:55,666
Doing whatever you feel like.

10
00:00:56,958 --> 00:00:58,500
Let me say this one more time.

11
00:00:59,375 --> 00:01:00,750
I don't love you.

12
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,250
Lin Zai.

13
00:01:03,416 --> 00:01:04,583
Don't be like this.

14
00:01:07,291 --> 00:01:08,583
Then tell me.

15
00:01:08,916 --> 00:01:10,207
What am I supposed to do?

16
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,875
How do we get back to how things were?

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,166
Do you even know what I need most?

18
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:27,458
I need a peaceful, stable life.

19
00:01:28,076 --> 00:01:30,326
Not living on edge every single day.

20
00:01:32,458 --> 00:01:34,000
I need someone

21
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,166
who understands my fears,

22
00:01:36,875 --> 00:01:38,208
who understands my vulnerability.

23
00:01:39,333 --> 00:01:41,083
Can you give me that?

24
00:01:43,666 --> 00:01:45,416
You can't even fathom it, can you?

25
00:01:46,583 --> 00:01:48,083
I can learn.

26
00:01:53,916 --> 00:01:55,582
But you've never once considered

27
00:01:55,583 --> 00:01:57,750
giving up your mission for me,

28
00:01:58,458 --> 00:01:59,458
have you?

29
00:02:11,083 --> 00:02:12,416
Where are you going now?

30
00:02:13,416 --> 00:02:15,083
Back to He Yao?

31
00:02:16,291 --> 00:02:18,785
Even at a time like this,
you're still saying things like that.

32
00:02:19,875 --> 00:02:22,125
That only proves you
don't understand me at all.

33
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:23,500
"The Last Oath"

34
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:28,500
(Episode 18: Camp Duty Assignments)

35
00:04:37,583 --> 00:04:38,708
How's the water temperature?

36
00:04:40,291 --> 00:04:41,583
It's just right.

37
00:04:45,583 --> 00:04:46,583
He Yao.

38
00:04:47,208 --> 00:04:48,208
You're here too?

39
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:51,207
I came to try some herbs for Grandma Qiu,

40
00:04:51,208 --> 00:04:53,368
and replenish Chen Jin's
electrolytes while I'm at it.

41
00:04:53,916 --> 00:04:55,250
Doctor He is so considerate,

42
00:04:55,625 --> 00:04:57,166
always keeping me in mind.

43
00:04:57,541 --> 00:04:58,875
Thank you so much.

44
00:04:59,793 --> 00:05:07,311
Doctor He has helped us so much,
I really don't know how to thank you.

45
00:05:08,583 --> 00:05:10,250
Please don't mention it, Grandma Qiu.

46
00:05:10,583 --> 00:05:11,892
Lin Zai is my junior from school.

47
00:05:11,916 --> 00:05:13,583
Looking after you is the least I can do.

48
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:15,750
Junior?

49
00:05:16,416 --> 00:05:17,958
Yeah. Alumni.

50
00:05:21,125 --> 00:05:23,582
I heard you used to be in the same camp.

51
00:05:23,583 --> 00:05:24,583
We were.

52
00:05:25,250 --> 00:05:27,875
Lin Zai is top-notch around here.

53
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:30,124
He can fix anything.

54
00:05:30,125 --> 00:05:31,458
Meticulous, too.

55
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,000
Come in.

56
00:06:31,333 --> 00:06:32,415
Lin Zai.

57
00:06:32,416 --> 00:06:33,915
Coming to see me at this hour?

58
00:06:33,916 --> 00:06:34,916
Is something wrong?

59
00:06:37,250 --> 00:06:38,750
I wanted to check on my brother.

60
00:06:39,333 --> 00:06:41,375
How is he doing?

61
00:06:42,333 --> 00:06:43,458
Same as before.

62
00:06:43,708 --> 00:06:45,249
Within the current observation window,

63
00:06:45,250 --> 00:06:47,290
his vitals haven't shown
any abnormal fluctuations.

64
00:06:49,375 --> 00:06:50,041
Lin Zai,

65
00:06:50,042 --> 00:06:51,416
I know you're anxious.

66
00:06:51,583 --> 00:06:52,458
But research

67
00:06:52,459 --> 00:06:54,583
requires focus and an
undisturbed environment.

68
00:06:55,208 --> 00:06:57,290
Unless I ask for you,

69
00:06:57,291 --> 00:06:58,582
try not to come around.

70
00:06:58,583 --> 00:06:59,999
It's best for your brother's stability

71
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,250
and the continuity of my work.

72
00:07:03,166 --> 00:07:05,083
I just wanted to see
if he's doing all right.

73
00:07:05,541 --> 00:07:06,941
I didn't mean to disrupt your work.

74
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:08,750
I understand.

75
00:07:09,375 --> 00:07:11,583
Actually, there's something
I want to show you.

76
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:21,999
Using your blood sample

77
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,374
combined with the earlier cultures,

78
00:07:23,375 --> 00:07:25,125
I synthesized an initial test solution.

79
00:07:26,208 --> 00:07:26,958
In theory,

80
00:07:26,959 --> 00:07:29,583
it enhances binding affinity
to specific viral proteins.

81
00:07:29,666 --> 00:07:31,250
Want to see the preliminary results?

82
00:07:31,666 --> 00:07:34,083
Even though it's still
in the testing phase.

83
00:07:35,875 --> 00:07:36,875
Yes.

84
00:07:37,666 --> 00:07:38,666
Follow me.

85
00:07:44,916 --> 00:07:46,500
Help me pull back this sheet.

86
00:08:55,208 --> 00:08:55,791
Brother.

87
00:08:56,125 --> 00:08:57,125
Brother.

88
00:08:57,291 --> 00:08:58,333
Can you hear me, Brother?

89
00:08:59,125 --> 00:09:00,333
It's Lin Zai. Brother.

90
00:09:02,083 --> 00:09:02,791
Brother.

91
00:09:02,791 --> 00:09:03,791
Easy now.

92
00:09:04,458 --> 00:09:07,250
The test solution reacted
with the virus in his body.

93
00:09:07,416 --> 00:09:10,059
It significantly suppressed the
abnormal firing of his motor neurons.

94
00:09:10,083 --> 00:09:10,625
Because of that,

95
00:09:10,916 --> 00:09:12,583
his agitation has subsided.

96
00:09:13,041 --> 00:09:15,999
However, the infection signals
in his central nervous system

97
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,416
have barely dropped at all.

98
00:09:17,583 --> 00:09:21,291
This vial is still a long
way from waking him up.

99
00:09:24,083 --> 00:09:27,000
At least it proves
we're on the right track.

100
00:09:27,125 --> 00:09:29,040
Still, regarding dosage and purity—

101
00:09:29,041 --> 00:09:29,916
or rather,

102
00:09:29,917 --> 00:09:30,999
we haven't found the key yet,

103
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,726
the one that can truly
cross the blood-brain barrier

104
00:09:32,750 --> 00:09:34,958
and precisely neutralize the core virus.

105
00:09:35,708 --> 00:09:37,125
It needs more calibration,

106
00:09:37,291 --> 00:09:38,291
more testing,

107
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:42,583
and more of your blood
for analysis and refinement.

108
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:45,916
I understand.

109
00:09:47,666 --> 00:09:49,458
As long as it saves my brother,

110
00:09:50,416 --> 00:09:51,750
no matter how long it takes,

111
00:09:52,416 --> 00:09:53,750
how much time it requires,

112
00:09:54,500 --> 00:09:55,791
or what you need me to do,

113
00:09:56,125 --> 00:09:57,208
I'll cooperate fully.

114
00:10:00,375 --> 00:10:01,375
He Yao,

115
00:10:01,791 --> 00:10:03,071
keep going with the experiments.

116
00:10:03,583 --> 00:10:05,083
I'll be fine.

117
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,166
All right.

118
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,708
Remember your words. And remember,

119
00:10:10,083 --> 00:10:11,749
keeping yourself stable

120
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:13,500
is crucial for this research to continue.

121
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:38,208
Where's that boy A-Leh?

122
00:10:39,125 --> 00:10:41,083
He didn't even show up for dinner.

123
00:10:43,250 --> 00:10:46,166
Are you two okay?

124
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:52,291
He looked terrible today.

125
00:10:53,958 --> 00:10:55,125
Everything's fine, Grandma.

126
00:10:56,125 --> 00:10:57,125
He...

127
00:10:57,375 --> 00:10:59,255
probably just wants
to be left alone for a bit.

128
00:11:18,333 --> 00:11:19,333
Sister Chen,

129
00:11:19,375 --> 00:11:20,415
look after Grandma for a moment.

130
00:11:20,416 --> 00:11:21,416
I'll go check on him.

131
00:11:21,458 --> 00:11:22,458
Got it. Go ahead.

132
00:11:59,916 --> 00:12:00,916
Lin Zai.

133
00:12:03,166 --> 00:12:04,166
Lin Zai.

134
00:12:22,333 --> 00:12:23,750
Curfew is now in effect.

135
00:12:23,875 --> 00:12:25,916
Please return to your quarters.

136
00:12:26,125 --> 00:12:27,285
Secure all doors and windows.

137
00:12:27,416 --> 00:12:28,416
Stay safe.

138
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,375
Curfew is now in effect.

139
00:12:31,541 --> 00:12:33,583
Please return to your quarters.

140
00:12:33,791 --> 00:12:34,951
Secure all doors and windows.

141
00:12:35,083 --> 00:12:36,083
Stay safe.

142
00:12:37,916 --> 00:12:39,291
Curfew is now in effect.

143
00:12:39,416 --> 00:12:41,500
Please return to your quarters.

144
00:12:41,708 --> 00:12:42,868
Secure all doors and windows.

145
00:12:42,916 --> 00:12:43,958
Stay safe.

146
00:13:16,541 --> 00:13:17,541
Lin Zai.

147
00:13:18,541 --> 00:13:19,541
Time to head inside.

148
00:13:19,542 --> 00:13:21,291
The patrol will be doing roll call soon.

149
00:13:23,583 --> 00:13:25,333
Yeah. Understood.

150
00:13:27,458 --> 00:13:28,583
Are you holding up okay?

151
00:13:47,708 --> 00:13:49,458
Lin Zai, you all right?

152
00:13:51,875 --> 00:13:53,125
I'm fine, Sister Chen.

153
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,250
Just a little tired.

154
00:13:55,416 --> 00:13:56,750
Needed some fresh air.

155
00:13:59,583 --> 00:14:01,000
If you're tired, get some rest.

156
00:14:01,208 --> 00:14:02,750
Don't push yourself so hard.

157
00:14:04,208 --> 00:14:05,583
If you want to talk,

158
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:07,083
I'm right here listening.

159
00:14:12,291 --> 00:14:13,416
To A-Leh, I've been...

160
00:14:14,708 --> 00:14:16,541
I said some awful things to A-Leh.

161
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,750
I told him he doesn't understand feelings,

162
00:14:23,541 --> 00:14:24,541
and...

163
00:14:25,625 --> 00:14:27,541
so many other hurtful things.

164
00:14:34,583 --> 00:14:36,000
But I didn't have a choice.

165
00:14:38,416 --> 00:14:40,583
Knowing there's such a
massive rift between us,

166
00:14:42,916 --> 00:14:44,250
dragging this out

167
00:14:44,791 --> 00:14:46,291
won't end well anyway.

168
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:48,750
It was better to make a clean break.

169
00:14:49,458 --> 00:14:50,458
Right?

170
00:14:53,583 --> 00:14:55,000
Yet I still can't let go.

171
00:14:59,458 --> 00:15:00,458
I can't let go.

172
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:04,375
Even if I can't, what else can I do?

173
00:15:06,666 --> 00:15:08,875
I have my own reasons for doing this.

174
00:15:39,708 --> 00:15:41,083
Feeling any discomfort?

175
00:16:07,333 --> 00:16:07,791
Press down here.

176
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Hold it for five minutes.

177
00:16:09,125 --> 00:16:11,291
We drew a bit more blood than last time.

178
00:16:16,708 --> 00:16:17,749
Drink this.

179
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:18,333
It's an iron supplement.

180
00:16:18,583 --> 00:16:20,083
It'll help your recovery.

181
00:16:22,541 --> 00:16:24,250
Go back and rest early today.

182
00:16:24,333 --> 00:16:26,082
If you feel dizzy or your
heart starts pounding,

183
00:16:26,083 --> 00:16:27,250
lie down immediately.

184
00:16:41,083 --> 00:16:42,083
If you need anything,

185
00:16:42,250 --> 00:16:43,458
come see me anytime.

186
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:44,500
All right.

187
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:00,750
Hold on.

188
00:17:00,916 --> 00:17:01,916
Take it easy.

189
00:17:02,208 --> 00:17:03,458
Sit for a little longer.

190
00:17:07,208 --> 00:17:08,750
How's the research coming along?

191
00:17:11,916 --> 00:17:12,916
Lin Zai,

192
00:17:12,958 --> 00:17:14,458
experiments take time, day by day.

193
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:16,750
Your brother will get better, day by day.

194
00:17:18,916 --> 00:17:20,116
Can I come back tomorrow then?

195
00:17:20,375 --> 00:17:21,375
Is that all right?

196
00:17:21,875 --> 00:17:23,750
I want to see him recover quickly.

197
00:17:23,958 --> 00:17:25,083
The sooner, the better.

198
00:17:26,916 --> 00:17:27,916
Okay.

199
00:17:28,083 --> 00:17:29,083
But promise me

200
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:30,330
you'll look after yourself.

201
00:17:30,375 --> 00:17:31,125
When you get back today,

202
00:17:31,333 --> 00:17:32,208
eat a proper meal

203
00:17:32,250 --> 00:17:33,083
and get some sleep early.

204
00:17:33,125 --> 00:17:34,125
Okay.

205
00:17:35,125 --> 00:17:36,125
Wait.

206
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:38,125
Do you need me to walk you back?

207
00:17:38,375 --> 00:17:39,458
The way you look right now,

208
00:17:39,666 --> 00:17:41,306
I'm not comfortable letting you go alone.

209
00:17:41,583 --> 00:17:43,250
I'm fine. I can manage.

210
00:18:30,678 --> 00:18:31,958
(Lin Zai)
